---
layout: layouts/base.njk
tone: light
title: "Tuition and fees"
description: "Tuition for 2026-2027 at Palm River Academy in Hội An: the cost per quarter for each program, Global Program weekly prices, sibling discounts, meals and transport."
---
{% import "macros/icons.njk" as ic %}

{% set heroPhoto = "gallery-cupcake-decorating" %}
{% set heroEyebrow = "Admissions · 2026-2027" %}
{% set heroTitle = 'Tuition and <span class="mark">fees</span>' %}
{% set heroText = "Tuition for 2026-2027, in Vietnamese đồng. Anything not here, just ask." %}
{% include "partials/pagehero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Regular Program</p>
    <h2>Paid by the quarter</h2>
    <p class="lede">Four quarters a year, August to June. Each is paid before it starts.</p>
    <ul class="prices">
      <li class="price price--sun"><span class="price__name">Nursery</span><span class="price__ages">Early Years</span><span class="price__amount">33,500,000</span><span class="price__per">VND per quarter</span></li>
      <li class="price price--sun"><span class="price__name">Kindergarten</span><span class="price__ages">Early Years</span><span class="price__amount">44,000,000</span><span class="price__per">VND per quarter</span></li>
      <li class="price price--green"><span class="price__name">Primary</span><span class="price__ages">Years 1 to 6</span><span class="price__amount">56,000,000</span><span class="price__per">VND per quarter</span></li>
      <li class="price price--blue"><span class="price__name">Lower Secondary</span><span class="price__ages">Years 7 to 9</span><span class="price__amount">61,000,000</span><span class="price__per">VND per quarter</span></li>
      <li class="price price--coral"><span class="price__name">Upper Secondary</span><span class="price__ages">Ages 14 to 18</span><span class="price__amount price__amount--ask">Ask us</span><span class="price__per">Depends on the plan</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="table-note table-note--gap">Payments are due by 28 July, 8 October, 17 December and 22 March. Joining partway through the year? You pay from your child's first day.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--violet">Global Program</p>
    <h2>Priced by the week</h2>
    <p class="lede">For stays of three weeks to three months. The longer the stay, the less each week costs.</p>
    <div class="table-wrap mt">
      <table class="fees-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th rowspan="2">Pathway</th><th colspan="3" class="group">Price per week, by length of stay</th></tr>
          <tr><th class="num">3 to 5 weeks</th><th class="num">6 to 9 weeks</th><th class="num">10 to 12 weeks</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="fees-table__group"><td colspan="4">Early Years<small>Nursery and Kindergarten, ages 2 to 5</small></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Full day</td><td class="num" data-label="3 to 5 weeks">5,000,000</td><td class="num" data-label="6 to 9 weeks">4,500,000</td><td class="num" data-label="10 to 12 weeks">4,200,000</td></tr>
          <tr class="fees-table__group"><td colspan="4">Primary<small>Years 1 to 6</small></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Vocational, half day</td><td class="num" data-label="3 to 5 weeks">5,000,000</td><td class="num" data-label="6 to 9 weeks">4,500,000</td><td class="num" data-label="10 to 12 weeks">4,200,000</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Academic, half day *</td><td class="num" data-label="3 to 5 weeks">7,000,000</td><td class="num" data-label="6 to 9 weeks">6,800,000</td><td class="num" data-label="10 to 12 weeks">6,500,000</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cambridge and vocational, full day *</td><td class="num" data-label="3 to 5 weeks">9,200,000</td><td class="num" data-label="6 to 9 weeks">8,800,000</td><td class="num" data-label="10 to 12 weeks">8,500,000</td></tr>
          <tr class="fees-table__group"><td colspan="4">Lower Secondary<small>Years 7 to 9</small></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Vocational, half day</td><td class="num" data-label="3 to 5 weeks">5,200,000</td><td class="num" data-label="6 to 9 weeks">4,800,000</td><td class="num" data-label="10 to 12 weeks">4,400,000</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Academic, half day *</td><td class="num muted" data-label="3 to 5 weeks">not offered</td><td class="num" data-label="6 to 9 weeks">7,000,000</td><td class="num" data-label="10 to 12 weeks">6,700,000</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cambridge and vocational, full day *</td><td class="num muted" data-label="3 to 5 weeks">not offered</td><td class="num" data-label="6 to 9 weeks">9,100,000</td><td class="num" data-label="10 to 12 weeks">8,800,000</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <span class="swipe-hint">Swipe sideways to see the whole table.</span>
    <p class="table-note">All amounts in VND. * Needs enough English to follow Cambridge lessons. <a href="{{ '/learning/global-program/' | url }}">How the Global Program works</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Good to know</p>
      <h2>Siblings, meals and the bus</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="method">
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("users", "coral") }}<strong>Sibling discounts</strong><p>More than one child at PRA? Brothers and sisters get a discount.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("whisk", "sun") }}<strong>Meals</strong><p>Lunch and two snacks every day, if you want them. The menu goes home each week.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("bus", "blue") }}<strong>Transport</strong><p>Morning pick-up and afternoon drop-off around Hội An, Vĩnh Điện and Đà Nẵng.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale faq">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>The other questions</h2>
    <details><summary>How can we pay?</summary><p>Cash or bank transfer. Paying from abroad? Make sure the full amount arrives before your child's first day.</p></details>
    <details><summary>When is each payment due?</summary><p>Before each quarter starts: by 28 July, 8 October, 17 December and 22 March. The dates are also on the <a href="{{ '/families/schedule/#calendar' | url }}">calendar</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What if we join partway through the year?</summary><p>You pay from your child's first day, worked out from the class days left in that quarter.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How much are meals and transport?</summary><p>It depends on your child's age and your route. Ask us and we will send the current prices.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

